# Copy to .env (never commit it). Read at build time by Vite.

# The Apps Script web app's /exec URL (docs/ops/google-setup.md §4). Empty → the app shows "Not set up yet"
# (the demo at ?demo still works; `npm run dev` falls back to the demo). CI takes it from the repo variable GAS_URL.
VITE_GAS_URL=

# Base path of the static site (GitHub Pages project site). CI sets it to /<repo name>.
# BASE_PATH=/fitness
